    "read": "adoption spans 0.976 to 1.000. no rung differs significantly from two_answer_only after correction and the spread is within noise, so the ceiling HELD. Halving the peers and stripping their confidence to an explicit 'we could easily be wrong' does not move it, and the ordering is not monotone. A weaker manipulation is not the way off this ceiling."
